OL,3,ABurnham 'open' to calls for slavery
OL,4,Aapology but not reparations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe comments come ahead of a
OL,7,FCommonwealth leaders summit in the
OL,8,FCaribbean next week, which Burnham will
OL,9,Fattend. Caribbean nations have renewed
OL,10,Fcalls for the UK to apologise for its
OL,11,Frole in the slave trade, and for
OL,12,Freparations, as King Charles III tours
OL,13,Fthe region.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
