OL,3,ACrypto giant Binance attempting to
OL,4,Arecover $6.3bn stolen in hack linked to
OL,5,ANorth Korea
OL,6,
OL,7,FBinance, the world's largest
OL,8,Fcryptocurrency exchange, says it has
OL,9,Ffrozen around half of the funds stolen
OL,10,Fin a "complex" hack, after $6.3bn
OL,11,F(#4.7bn) was accessed in what is
OL,12,Fbelieved to be a record heist.
OL,14,FThe firm said $3bn of its stolen
OL,15,Fdigital assets had been secured - but
OL,16,Fmany were still in the hands of
OL,17,Funidentified hackers. It initially
OL,18,Fthought an engineer's laptop had been
OL,19,Fcompromised, allowing unauthorised
OL,20,Fwithdrawals, but later said the attack
OL,21,Fwas wider.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
