OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhy North Korea's 'elite' hackers are
OL,4,Athe prime suspect in major Binance hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo major blockchain analytics firms
OL,7,Fsay they have robust intelligence
OL,8,Fpointing to a North Korean state-backed
OL,9,Fgroup as the likely culprits in the
OL,10,F$6.3bn (#4.7bn) hack of Binance, the
OL,11,Fworld's largest cryptocurrency
OL,12,Fexchange.
OL,14,FThe Lazarus Group, a North Korean
OL,15,Fhacking unit also known as
OL,16,FTraderTraitor, was identified "with
OL,17,Fhigh confidence" by TRM Labs, as well
OL,18,Fas Chainalysis.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
